{"id":"8897836127fd93b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-order6-order-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Order6 Order Embedding","display":"df-zfc-order6-order-embedding — ZFC Order6 Order Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order6-order-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order6-order-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-order6-order-embedding — ZFC Order6 Order Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-embedding]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order6-order-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order6-order-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order6-order-embedding — ZFC Order6 Order Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17222759f0140cdd\" href=\"?note=17222759f0140cdd\" title=\"58-df-embedding\">58-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (ordered carriers, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Y\\times Y\">\\(S\\subseteq Y\\times Y\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S\\)</span> (order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderEmbedding}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Order}_S(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{Order}_S(Y,S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle f(a),f(b)\\rangle\\in S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6OrderEmbedding}_S(X,R,Y,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Order}_S(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{Order}_S(Y,S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall a,b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle f(a),f(b)\\rangle\\in S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reflection of the order implies injectivity for reflexive antisymmetric orders; the exact registered function predicate supplies totality and single-valuedness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"17222759f0140cdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y$ (ordered carriers, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ (function, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (three-place function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"tar